 Intel(R) Core(TM) i9-13900H (20 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen exporting Godot to WebAssembly using an export template built with `dlink_enabled=yes` it fails at runtime with:\n\n```\nAborted(Assertion failed: Tried to dlsym() from an unopened handle: -1)\n```\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/939814e4-fb04-4a28-8e9a-44cd0253a898)\n\ncc/ @adamscott \n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Build web export template with `dlink_enabled=yes`\n```\nscons platform=web target=template_release dlink_enabled=yes use_threads=yes\n```\n\n2. Open any project and export for web (using the above template)\n3. Run the project\n\n```\nAborted(Assertion failed: Tried to dlsym() from an unopened handle: -1)\n```\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nDefault project","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105766/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105766/timeline",